Leave the MSVC SDK case overlays out of toolchains that run on Windows.

From https://github.com/hermeticbuild/hermetic-llvm/issues/809. On a Windows
exec host, //tools/case_insensitive_vfs (which builds the overlays) resolves the
same MSVC toolchain that needs the overlays, so analysis fails with a cycle.
Windows file systems are case-insensitive, so those toolchains skip them.
Drop this patch once a llvm release includes the fix.

